<!-- P1 (find_feature_plan.md, A7, D14): one part, one complete 4/4 bar.
       C#4 - <accidental cautionary="yes">sharp</accidental> -> "cautionary sharp"
       Db4 - <accidental editorial="yes">flat</accidental>   -> "editorial flat"
       E4  - plain <accidental>natural</accidental> (NEITHER cautionary nor
             editorial) -> the `accidental` key must be ABSENT (D14: a plain
             printed accidental is already spoken inside the step name)
       F4  - no <accidental> at all
     Complete bar, so pickup detection does not fire. -->
